  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Media Freedom Coalition Secretariat is the dedicated staff team supporting the Media Freedom Coalition, a partnership of over 50 states from 6 continents that work together to promote media freedom at home and abroad. This project will support the Secretariat to engage ODA-eligible member countries in the work of the MFC, and to facilitate media freedom activities by member countries in ODA-eligible countries.</narrative>
